      "content": "Control... I haven't felt that in a long, long time. Everything just happened to me. But the steel, it's still here. It's steady. It doesn't lie or break like my people did. It feels like the only thing left that actually understands what I need right now. Is it wrong to want to just... use it to find that dignity you mentioned?",
